§§ `Entries "in writing", "breach", "final"`

`handwriting` MEANS `A presentation of letters, numerals or signs` WITH
    `it is writing in the ordinary sense` IS TRUE, `it presents letters, numerals or signs` IS TRUE, `in a form visible to the eye` IS TRUE, `in a form capable of being decoded visually` IS FALSE, `it presents letters` IS FALSE, `it presents numerals` IS FALSE, `it presents signs` IS FALSE
`a screen display of characters` MEANS `A presentation of letters, numerals or signs` WITH
    `it is writing in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it presents letters, numerals or signs` IS TRUE, `in a form visible to the eye` IS TRUE, `in a form capable of being decoded visually` IS TRUE, `it presents letters` IS FALSE, `it presents numerals` IS FALSE, `it presents signs` IS FALSE
`a code of signs a reader must decode, not seen directly` MEANS `A presentation of letters, numerals or signs` WITH
    `it is writing in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it presents letters, numerals or signs` IS TRUE, `in a form visible to the eye` IS FALSE, `in a form capable of being decoded visually` IS TRUE, `it presents letters` IS FALSE, `it presents numerals` IS FALSE, `it presents signs` IS FALSE
`a sound recording of letters` MEANS `A presentation of letters, numerals or signs` WITH
    `it is writing in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it presents letters, numerals or signs` IS TRUE, `in a form visible to the eye` IS FALSE, `in a form capable of being decoded visually` IS FALSE, `it presents letters` IS FALSE, `it presents numerals` IS FALSE, `it presents signs` IS FALSE
`a drawing with no letters, numerals or signs` MEANS `A presentation of letters, numerals or signs` WITH
    `it is writing in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it presents letters, numerals or signs` IS FALSE, `in a form visible to the eye` IS TRUE, `in a form capable of being decoded visually` IS TRUE, `it presents letters` IS FALSE, `it presents numerals` IS FALSE, `it presents signs` IS FALSE

`a printed page of letters only` MEANS `A presentation of letters, numerals or signs` WITH
    `it is writing in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it presents letters, numerals or signs` IS FALSE, `in a form visible to the eye` IS TRUE, `in a form capable of being decoded visually` IS FALSE, `it presents letters` IS TRUE, `it presents numerals` IS FALSE, `it presents signs` IS FALSE
`a table of numerals only` MEANS `A presentation of letters, numerals or signs` WITH
    `it is writing in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it presents letters, numerals or signs` IS FALSE, `in a form visible to the eye` IS TRUE, `in a form capable of being decoded visually` IS FALSE, `it presents letters` IS FALSE, `it presents numerals` IS TRUE, `it presents signs` IS FALSE
`a notation of signs only` MEANS `A presentation of letters, numerals or signs` WITH
    `it is writing in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it presents letters, numerals or signs` IS FALSE, `in a form visible to the eye` IS TRUE, `in a form capable of being decoded visually` IS FALSE, `it presents letters` IS FALSE, `it presents numerals` IS FALSE, `it presents signs` IS TRUE
`letters out of sight and not decodable` MEANS `A presentation of letters, numerals or signs` WITH
    `it is writing in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it presents letters, numerals or signs` IS FALSE, `in a form visible to the eye` IS FALSE, `in a form capable of being decoded visually` IS FALSE, `it presents letters` IS TRUE, `it presents numerals` IS FALSE, `it presents signs` IS FALSE

