#ASSERT `s 3 "district" — the division is a district:` (`A division of the State's area` WITH `it is an administrative district` IS TRUE, `the area of the State is divided into it by the Government` IS TRUE, `the division is made by virtue of` IS `a mandate-era ordinance`)
#ASSERT NOT `s 3 "district" — the division is a district:` (`A division of the State's area` WITH `it is an administrative district` IS FALSE, `the area of the State is divided into it by the Government` IS TRUE, `the division is made by virtue of` IS `a law passed by the Knesset`)
#ASSERT NOT `s 3 "district" — the division is a district:` (`A division of the State's area` WITH `it is an administrative district` IS TRUE, `the area of the State is divided into it by the Government` IS FALSE, `the division is made by virtue of` IS `a law passed by the Knesset`)
#ASSERT NOT `s 3 "district" — the division is a district:` (`A division of the State's area` WITH `it is an administrative district` IS TRUE, `the area of the State is divided into it by the Government` IS TRUE, `the division is made by virtue of` IS `something that is none of those`)

