§§ `Entry "possession"`

`ownership-like holding` MEANS `A holding of land` WITH
    `it is possession in the ordinary sense` IS TRUE, `it is use, possession or enjoyment` IS FALSE, `it is as an employee or official only` IS FALSE, `it is for supervision or guarding only` IS FALSE, `it is use` IS FALSE, `it is possession` IS FALSE, `it is enjoyment` IS FALSE
`use by someone for themselves` MEANS `A holding of land` WITH
    `it is possession in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it is use, possession or enjoyment` IS TRUE, `it is as an employee or official only` IS FALSE, `it is for supervision or guarding only` IS FALSE, `it is use` IS FALSE, `it is possession` IS FALSE, `it is enjoyment` IS FALSE
`use as an employee only` MEANS `A holding of land` WITH
    `it is possession in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it is use, possession or enjoyment` IS TRUE, `it is as an employee or official only` IS TRUE, `it is for supervision or guarding only` IS FALSE, `it is use` IS FALSE, `it is possession` IS FALSE, `it is enjoyment` IS FALSE
`use for guarding only` MEANS `A holding of land` WITH
    `it is possession in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it is use, possession or enjoyment` IS TRUE, `it is as an employee or official only` IS FALSE, `it is for supervision or guarding only` IS TRUE, `it is use` IS FALSE, `it is possession` IS FALSE, `it is enjoyment` IS FALSE
`no holding at all` MEANS `A holding of land` WITH
    `it is possession in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it is use, possession or enjoyment` IS FALSE, `it is as an employee or official only` IS FALSE, `it is for supervision or guarding only` IS FALSE, `it is use` IS FALSE, `it is possession` IS FALSE, `it is enjoyment` IS FALSE

`use alone` MEANS `A holding of land` WITH
    `it is possession in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it is use, possession or enjoyment` IS FALSE, `it is as an employee or official only` IS FALSE, `it is for supervision or guarding only` IS FALSE, `it is use` IS TRUE, `it is possession` IS FALSE, `it is enjoyment` IS FALSE
`possession alone` MEANS `A holding of land` WITH
    `it is possession in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it is use, possession or enjoyment` IS FALSE, `it is as an employee or official only` IS FALSE, `it is for supervision or guarding only` IS FALSE, `it is use` IS FALSE, `it is possession` IS TRUE, `it is enjoyment` IS FALSE
`enjoyment alone` MEANS `A holding of land` WITH
    `it is possession in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it is use, possession or enjoyment` IS FALSE, `it is as an employee or official only` IS FALSE, `it is for supervision or guarding only` IS FALSE, `it is use` IS FALSE, `it is possession` IS FALSE, `it is enjoyment` IS TRUE
`enjoyment as an employee only` MEANS `A holding of land` WITH
    `it is possession in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it is use, possession or enjoyment` IS FALSE, `it is as an employee or official only` IS TRUE, `it is for supervision or guarding only` IS FALSE, `it is use` IS FALSE, `it is possession` IS FALSE, `it is enjoyment` IS TRUE
`possession for guarding only` MEANS `A holding of land` WITH
    `it is possession in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `it is use, possession or enjoyment` IS FALSE, `it is as an employee or official only` IS FALSE, `it is for supervision or guarding only` IS TRUE, `it is use` IS FALSE, `it is possession` IS TRUE, `it is enjoyment` IS FALSE

-- tests: L3d24
#ASSERT `s 3 "possession" — the holding of land is possession:` `ownership-like holding`
#ASSERT `s 3 "possession" — the holding of land is possession:` `use by someone for themselves`
#ASSERT NOT `s 3 "possession" — the holding of land is possession:` `use as an employee only`
#ASSERT NOT `s 3 "possession" — the holding of land is possession:` `use for guarding only`
#ASSERT NOT `s 3 "possession" — the holding of land is possession:` `no holding at all`
-- The three things the entry names are fields of their own beside the phrase as printed.
#ASSERT `s 3 "possession" — the holding of land is possession:` `use alone`
#ASSERT `s 3 "possession" — the holding of land is possession:` `possession alone`
#ASSERT `s 3 "possession" — the holding of land is possession:` `enjoyment alone`
#ASSERT NOT `s 3 "possession" — the holding of land is possession:` `enjoyment as an employee only`
#ASSERT NOT `s 3 "possession" — the holding of land is possession:` `possession for guarding only`
