#ASSERT NOT `s 3 "possession" — the holding of land is possession, if supervision or guarding is a limb of what is included:` `use as an employee only`
#ASSERT `s 3 "possession" — the holding of land is possession, if supervision or guarding is a limb of what is included:` `use by someone for themselves`

