-- s 3 is subject to s 1's gate.
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 3 — section 3 governs` `the entry on "law"` `in an enactment given on` (YMD 1990 1 1) `, for` `a matter another provision deals with` BECAUSE "the Law is displaced here: another provision deals with the matter, or the matter or its context is inconsistent with the Law, so the Law does not say what the words mean"
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 3 — section 3 governs` `the entry on "sin"` `in an enactment given on` (YMD 1960 5 1) `, for` `a matter whose context is inconsistent with the Law`

